BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Santa's Riverboat Arrival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T133000
UID:d70661118d09ec2252156699d2c7dd0d@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Watch Santa and Mrs. Claus cruise into town on a Lind Marine t
 ugboat Saturday\, November 28\, for photos and festivities. Arrive at 11:3
 0 am with your family and friends to enjoy live entertainment from the Pac
 ific Empire Chorus while waiting for Santa and Mrs. Claus to arrive! By no
 on\, the couple will disembark at the Turning Basin. Young Nutcracker-cost
 umed dancers from Petaluma School of Ballet will escort the couple to thei
 r special holiday tent adjacent to Taps on the River for photos with eager
  children. The jolly pair will leave at 1:30 pm for their next stop on the
 ir holiday tour. November 28 is also Shop Small Saturday. As you queue up 
 for photos\, grab a Shop Small bag filled with items from local merchants\
 , while supply lasts. Bring your holiday shopping lists and support local!
  Historic downtown\, filled with boutiques from chic to quirky and fortify
 ing farm-to-table dining and tasting rooms\, is just a couple blocks away.
  The kids will love spotting Holiday Hen Hunt chickens in
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/santa-s-riverboat-
 arrival-11-28-2026
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Petaluma Holiday Shopping Stroll
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T170000
UID:ef22675d1ef31f1b168e19a38b0330eb@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season in Downtown Petaluma! Wander through fest
 ively decorated streets\, discover one-of-a-kind gifts in local shops\, an
 d enjoy holiday treats\, cheerful libations\, live music\, and extended st
 ore hours. All activities will take place inside participating businesses.
  Whether you’re hunting hens\, shopping for loved ones\, or simply soaki
 ng in the holiday spirit\, there’s something fun on every corner. EVENT 
 SCHEDULE: 11:30 am – 1:00 pm: Photos with Santa & Mrs. Claus 12:00 pm 
 – 2:00 pm: FREE Balloon Animals by Budderball the Clown 11:00 am – 2:0
 0 pm: Apple Tree Morris Dancers Pacific Empire Chorus THROUGHOUT THE DAY Y
 OU CAN ENJOY: Special holiday promotions & in-store activities Festive bit
 es and drinks Live local music Holiday décor & photo ops 2nd Annual Holid
 ay Hen Hunt\, details (https://petalumadowntown.com/holiday-hen-hunt) And 
 much more! See list of participating businesses offering special holiday a
 ctivities and treats on the website.
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/downtown-petaluma-
 holiday-shopping-stroll
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
