BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2027 Labor Law Updates
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T113000
UID:8d41e6986461b2819898a04bd27b2ddf@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Program Description Year after year\, California creates a myr
 iad of new employment laws – not to mention a copious number of cases an
 d administrative decisions. And then there’s all the federal content. It
 ’s enough to make anyone go numb! But don’t turn a deaf ear\, because 
 staying up-to-date on the latest employment legislation for 2027\, as well
  as the 2026 cases and administrative opinions\, is critical for employer 
 protection. In this comprehensive program\, LightGabler co-founder and man
 aging partner Jonathan Fraser Light will present the 2027 employment law u
 pdate. Attendees will receive a detailed handout providing insights into a
 t least 100 new laws\, regulations and cases\, along with practice tips fo
 r employers and human resource professionals. Topics on the horizon for th
 e 2027 New Year include: 2027 new legislation 2026 case law Arbitration up
 dates Artificial intelligence legislation Developments in FEHA Development
 s regarding diversity\, equity\, and inclusion Minimum wage increas
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/2027-labor-law-upd
 ates
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
