BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pints & Perfume: Holiday Perfume & Cologne Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261119T200000
UID:264c3c39eddc8968b92ace46a692deaa@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Grasse-Trained Perfumer Brings Holiday Scent Blending to Crook
 ed Goat Brewing in Petaluma Boho Bungalow's "Pints & Perfume" invites gues
 ts to blend a custom perfume or cologne over a pint\, Thursday\, Nov. 19 P
 ETALUMA\, Calif. — Boho Bungalow\, the Sonoma County boutique known for 
 its house-made Bohemian Botanicals fragrance line\, is teaming up with Cro
 oked Goat Brewing for Pints & Perfume: Holiday Perfume & Cologne Night\, o
 n Thursday\, Nov. 19\, from 6 to 8 p.m. at Crooked Goat's Petaluma taproom
 \, 110 Howard Street. Guests will smell\, sip\, blend and pour their way t
 o a one-of-a-kind 30 ml perfume or cologne\, guided by Boho Bungalow found
 er Faith Parker\, who studied perfumery in Grasse\, France\, the historic 
 home of the perfume industry. Each guest learns how Top\, Middle and Base 
 notes come together\, names their creation\, and takes it home holiday gif
 t-wrapped\, along with a formula card so the scent can be reordered anytim
 e.
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/pints-perfume-holi
 day-perfume-cologne-night
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
